'''Ultimate Bondage Cat''' (猫縛り極上 Neko Shibari Gokujō, ''Lit. '''Exquisite Bondage Cat''''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Ultimate Bondage Cat
|image = E 130.png
|appearance = [[Bondage Awakens!]]<br>
[[Deadly Carnival II]]
|money drop = 960¢ - 3,792¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high health, high damage, and mediocre range. Good meatshielding can stall this enemy, but it becomes deadly in stacks.

